rows.text:
符合下列三項條件
（三項皆需符合）：
1.Stressful lifting work must have been performed for a fairly consecutive period of 8-10 years;
2.The lifting work amounted to 8-10 tonnes per day;
3.The lifted objects weighed at least 50 kilos each (for men) or 35 kilos each (for women).
[註] 若負荷特別重，則上述標準可視情況減低。詳見該文件。
